Content/Materials/
Content/Maps/
Content/Collections/
Content/Developers/
Content/__ExternalActors__/
Content/__ExternalObjects__/

# LA PLACE: generated world / kit / texture / audio outputs (rebuilt by Tools/world, Tools/kit, Tools/textures, Tools/audio)
SourceArt/World/
